perties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"大滝","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 滝","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"06364","municipality_pref":"山形県","municipality_name":"真室川町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"610"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.1631317138672,39.04933547973633]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"烏帽子岩","category":"nature","address":"山地（非火山性）景観 / 山地 断崖・岩壁","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"06364","municipality_pref":"山形県","municipality_name":"真室川町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"212"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[140.30996704101562,39.01123046875]}}],"display_comment_original":"真室川町周辺には、近世村の記憶として内町村、新町村、平岡村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、釜渕遺跡、谷口銀山跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、内町村、新町村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["近岡理一郎","松沢雄蔵","沓沢朝治"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["真室川梅まつり","真室川音頭全国大会","真室川ブギウギ音楽祭","真室川まつり","巨木の森コンサート","番楽フェスティバル","真室川梅林公園","加無山県立自然公園（男甑山・女甑山・男加無山・女加無山・萱森・丁岳）"],"specialties":[],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":[],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%A4%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11638420","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11531726","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11552453","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E8%BF%91%E5%B2%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%80%E9%83%8E&keyword=%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%A4%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"真室川町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110796867","wikidata_qid":"Q1349021","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%9C%9F%E5%AE%A4%E5%B7%9D%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E8%BF%91%E5%B2%A1%E7%90%86%E4%B8%80%